# Registers the reader for daikin.config.json, so the service takes its settings from the
# same file the CLI does. It has to be an EnvironmentPostProcessor rather than a bean: the
# properties must be on the environment before @ConfigurationProperties is bound.
org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
io.github.chelin1974.daikinhome.web.JsonConfigEnvironmentPostProcessor
